                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg95">p. 95</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d143-f2" n="1" xml:id="d143-f2-content">
                <p>The mission arrived at San Francisco, Aug. 13. See footnote 1, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg20">p. 20</ref>.</p>
